  revisions) and rejoin words hyphenated across line breaks
- Note Volt Tackle breeding (Light Ball) on the Pichu family pages
- Spit Up power is variable; self-targeting moves show no accuracy
- Name fixes: Soft-Boiled, Tiny Mushroom, Lightning Rod, Compound Eyes,
  Tiny Raccoon/Swallow, FlyScorpion, "an Up-Grade", Silph Co.,
  Diglett's Cave, House/Room numbering

